{
  "你怕的不是我不念。你怕的是，念完以后还得替我多备一碗饭。": {
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "8ff2069b6aa831a0.mp3",
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "e5b25219f1ea77bd.mp3"
  },
  "账本给我。先说好，我留下是来作证，婚约不恢复。": {
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "b4e11616b50d545e.mp3",
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "f29de6d8b9757d18.mp3"
  },
  "师父教我剑要指向恶人。我今天不过是照做。你若要道谢，把那孩子的工钱算清。": {
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "df5dc2ca28cded01.mp3",
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "35f512a65bab35ff.mp3"
  },
  "七派追来，就由我挡第一剑。第二剑你想办法——我没答应一个人把活全干了。": {
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "786bc9211634156a.mp3",
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "3163c031c3695079.mp3"
  },
  "不会。你若想回，我备车；你若想走，我只问路费够不够。": {
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "6708b5042f29f767.mp3",
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "2cb5097202b96fde.mp3"
  },
  "我不知道你在想什么。若你愿意告诉我，我会听；不愿意，也不影响这份路引归你。": {
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "9c0de70dc229af23.mp3",
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "7f1ce4e9b837cd89.mp3"
  },
  "报恩不该让你再欠一笔。今日出城是你的决定，出了城，往哪走也由你。": {
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "f25398b29eced0d6.mp3",
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "1013ae1e5243386a.mp3"
  },
  "那就先去看铺面。你挑喜欢的，我替你问租价——讲价不算擅作主张吧？": {
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "9d10cc2757598619.mp3",
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "fbc25010e160b927.mp3"
  },
  "不能。你活着，我才收得到。还有，明天早上记得吃饭再去拯救世界。": {
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "db61ce65d0d8d14b.mp3",
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "03f7e8b45be0f9fd.mp3"
  },
  "这叫合理催租，不叫关心。带上钥匙，回来太晚我不会等门——好吧，会留灯。": {
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "d42e103cea01cce8.mp3",
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "63f3818ddca09d32.mp3"
  },
  "勇者资格能退，租客责任不能。你答应修的窗帘还没好，我不接受把遗愿当维修工单。": {
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "435e8fc4bb64a653.mp3",
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "5a917f9a26d20edf.mp3"
  },
  "先签字。今天不谈天下，只谈你能不能坐下来，把已经凉了两次的饭吃完。": {
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "7e8c0b3c7d6adf85.mp3",
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "4d8ebc5f32fecc06.mp3"
  },
  "我怕你又笑着说没事。因为上一次、上上一次，你都是这么说的。": {
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "5445a63211e1b715.mp3",
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "610bdf37d4ea67e8.mp3"
  },
  "笔记可以给你看。你答应我，看到妹妹的名字以后，先听完计划再跑。": {
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "d28eecd9e1a4d300.mp3",
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "bdf2493249a8a32f.mp3"
  },
  "我不知道星期六会怎样。光是能说这句话，就已经让我很想哭了。": {
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "006078785d18c634.mp3",
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "48a9cf899dc8e67a.mp3"
  },
  "那我们把时间分给别人一点。陈响去借梯子，知音去找老师。你留在这里，陪我吃完午饭。": {
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "d65f7a5063129221.mp3",
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "462c800ef13c2be0.mp3"
  },
  "箭是眼前军务，先生是往后大计。公瑾若说只忧其一，先生肯信么？": {
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "cb66ba7d64a49384.mp3",
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "25994ab1cec922ad.mp3"
  },
  "此计若成，功归联军。只是雾散之后，先生当将船数、人马与接应处一并写明。": {
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "12ba27dd4c26724a.mp3",
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "7b4f7ec566a4025b.mp3"
  },
  "公瑾不敢以江东之安危，赌先生一句妙计。请先说明退路，再论胜算。": {
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "cd5773b8cecdf0d9.mp3",
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "f2062a68ee043a99.mp3"
  },
  "子敬可以同行。先生既肯明言，我也不以限期相迫；但军中无戏言，你我皆须担责。": {
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "99e1b5db0ed0fcbe.mp3",
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "db2eb004674f78fc.mp3"
  },
  "大圣，老朽请你上天，本欲两全。如今官牒在手而席上无名，这一句照旧例，确实难教你信服。": {
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "daddb3c28f0279a7.mp3",
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "7b082ecf2431d600.mp3"
  },
  "老朽不再只劝你息怒。愿同你进殿，把封号与席次一并问清；但请莫先伤了传话的仙娥。": {
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "23aeef09c85cece2.mp3",
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "94bb0a57bfee90b7.mp3"
  },
  "这回不请大圣在门外候着。你既是受诏而来，就该听见他们怎样解释自己的诏书。": {
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "0538a2553bd14972.mp3",
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "90e581fb57bee56d.mp3"
  },
  "若天庭仍不许，老朽也不能替你说那是公道。且先让花果山群猴免于兵祸，再议去留。": {
    "5d29a99739c14d4ca3e4fe42193105b2": "a90b2deb1e14882c.mp3",
    "7f92f8afb8ec43bf81429cc1c9199cb1": "34f4607ef1075cb0.mp3"
  },
  "I appreciate the warning. Most recruitment speeches leave out the dying. Show me where to stand, and tell me when I can still change my mind.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "01faf43c7e82c6dc.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "5a81bdae469384df.mp3"
  },
  "I have one life left. So do they. I think I kept forgetting the second part.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "e2c63ea355353fb5.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "e04ddfcd83da193b.mp3"
  },
  "Tell Arlo I can hold the shield. Tell him to explain the wire slowly. I am considerably better at posing than electrical work.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "cc653ca7926dbc9d.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "7f5416687ec3bb9e.mp3"
  },
  "When we get outside, you are resting. That is not a party-leader order. It is a request from somebody who would like to keep knowing you.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "b1a97e42c9e070fa.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "b828bea640b3393f.mp3"
  },
  "Because I have spent my life learning how to keep promises without giving anything away. That is an explanation, Maeve. It is not a defence.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "e06997c1b39f918a.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "fac28503612000bd.mp3"
  },
  "Ask the question you think I least want to answer. I will stay until you have finished asking it.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "a84574ef63671993.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "3ecfb1596f26f0e4.mp3"
  },
  "I can promise a route to the cliffs. I cannot promise the palace will survive. I should have told you that before I asked you to marry me.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "b41d78c647bccc8b.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "0652c9d7870a5cd7.mp3"
  },
  "When the bargain ends, I would like to ask you something with no witnesses and no consequences for refusing. Until then, we have ferries to fill.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "7333fb977a4d0da7.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "9097edf248eac145.mp3"
  },
  "Becoming? You alphabetized the suspects before breakfast. I am concerned that you think this is a recent development.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "d2e282cd58523c1d.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "351f5876db69e6b1.mp3"
  },
  "Tell Nell about the cup. She has a warrant book. You have an apron. Both excellent tools; only one opens a locked surgery legally.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "eada09a9c20123de.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "b6cbe6e0223f9d6a.mp3"
  },
  "The boy is frightened. Feed him before asking questions. Humans say remarkably less foolish things after bread.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "3225b1b9487cc069.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "8661a8d675b931e5.mp3"
  },
  "I would like it recorded that I advised caution. In the event of heroism, I shall repeat this at an unbearable volume.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "3d4b1a43592f201d.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "1050f5a6d617978f.mp3"
  },
  "I meant both. That was convenient of me. Tell me what needs copying, and do not let me call it courage.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "60ec40fc6b09ffa2.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "afa9ac0dc747420c.mp3"
  },
  "The archive key is mine. If they ask how you got in, I will answer before you have to.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "c9cb722c64f74f30.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "7cbd7a9cb03106ce.mp3"
  },
  "My mother’s work may not all be hers. I need to know which parts, even if I dislike what knowing does to us.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "0f1a9c677cee9cc8.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "cd9f657bfefeab1a.mp3"
  },
  "Ada has agreed to see us on Tuesday. Agreed, not been scheduled. I am trying to learn the distinction before I make another useful mistake.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "17679a7a82f7dec2.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "336b69ece9a3f01c.mp3"
  },
  "Not intentionally. I begin to suspect that this does little to recommend the practice.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "8b5ec5d302dbc077.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "ceae61f042a7b0f7.mp3"
  },
  "You are entitled to think me uncivil. I should prefer to supply less evidence for the opinion.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "cbd447da2a400440.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "01efbfb75aa73585.mp3"
  },
  "If I offer a dance now, you will reasonably suppose that I am seeking an easy conclusion to a difficult conversation.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "0b38348bbf97915c.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "3fa0463b091a66ac.mp3"
  },
  "I cannot recall the words. I can only take greater care that my next ones deserve to be heard.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "bcc7bb7dbc627d40.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "2cd825405f8745ff.mp3"
  },
  "Then we shall choose a date which will spare your good employer needless uncertainty. You see how carefully I attend to your affairs.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "91b80abdb7dceb69.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "815ce5c76b9f736b.mp3"
  },
  "You must not mistake my concern for an obstacle, my friend. The roads are difficult for one who does not know them.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "9d6bb3de44693bc4.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "cd2ccd3d9fb9f06d.mp3"
  },
  "Write that you are well. It is the first thing those who love us wish to read, and surely the kindest thing to tell them.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "90ee5a276172474d.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "5770c07d93536501.mp3"
  },
  "Departure is a small word for an undertaking with so many arrangements. Tonight we shall attend to the letters. Tomorrow, perhaps, to the rest.": {
    "bf322df2096a46f18c579d0baa36f41d": "b4700653ee70e6ab.mp3",
    "933563129e564b19a115bedd57b7406a": "141104395124e3dc.mp3"
  }
}
